WEBVTT

00:04:29.930 --> 00:04:31.763
to say, "I'm gay."

00:04:31.797 --> 00:04:33.430
And this has shifted opinion

00:04:33.463 --> 00:04:36.863
even in some of the most
conservative of places.

00:04:36.863 --> 00:04:38.297
Take the Pope.

00:04:38.330 --> 00:04:40.063
As Cardinal in 2010,

00:04:40.063 --> 00:04:42.597
he was completely against gay marriage.

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:43.963
He becomes Pope.

00:04:43.997 --> 00:04:47.297
And three years after the last sentence

00:04:47.330 --> 00:04:49.697
he comes out with "Who am I to judge?"

00:04:49.697 --> 00:04:53.697
And then today,
he's in favor of civil unions.

00:04:53.697 --> 00:04:56.897
As you're thinking
about technology changing ethics,

00:04:56.930 --> 00:05:00.763
you also have to consider that technology
is now moving exponentially.